From fcb08c1e042d2390e99c206f315b29875c9e0ea6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:26:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Entities for WASM server mods (API block 12)

Capability entities: read the level's mobs; spawn mobs and summon any entity
(an item_display is a moving model), answered by entity-spawned; move,
display, remove, teleport, push, heal, kill. Built on the services native
mods already had. API level 11; robit-demo example with harness support.
